La formule est légère, sèche rapidement et est d''un noir de jais pour une finition volumisante ultime.',7900,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/RevolutionBigLashWaterproofVolumeMascara1.webp?v=1766517497',10,1,'8453371789487','46428873752751','https://beautymarket.ma/products/revolution-big-lash-waterproof-volume-mascara',1,'["https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/RevolutionBigLashWaterproofVolumeMascara1.webp?v=1766517497","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/RevolutionBigLashWaterproofVolumeMascara4_1506d27a-98fc-4651-bf20-2b7fba20ddaf.webp?v=1786792437","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/RevolutionBigLashWaterproofVolumeMascara3_76184d14-7f5b-434e-8f97-23af51272f92.webp?v=1786792437","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/RevolutionBigLashWaterproofVolumeMascara2.webp?v=1786792437"]',NULL) ON CONFLICT(source_variant_id) DO NOTHING;
