      Reseda Luteola Extract, Arctostaphylos Uva Ursi Leaf Extract, Carum
      Petroselinum (Parsley) Extract, Cera Microcristallina (Microcrystalline Wax),
      Dimethicone, Paraffin, Phenoxyethanol, Propylene Glycol, Xanthan Gum,
      Cyclopentasiloxane, Cyclohexasiloxane, Potassium Sorbate, Parfum (Fragrance).





Composition de Dépiwhite.M SPF50+ Invisible


    Afficher la liste INCI


