À associer avec du repos et des soins adaptés pour optimiser la récupération musculaire.',7200,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/peakpharmacy-deep-freeze-deep-freeze-muscle-rescue-cold-spray-72.5ml-1729261746Deep-Freeze-Muscle-Rescue-Cold-Spray-72.5ml.jpg?v=1775234761',10,1,'8550534774959','46739868188847','https://beautymarket.ma/products/deep-freeze-muscle-rescue-cold-spray-72-5-ml',1,'["https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/peakpharmacy-deep-freeze-deep-freeze-muscle-rescue-cold-spray-72.5ml-1729261746Deep-Freeze-Muscle-Rescue-Cold-Spray-72.5ml.jpg?v=1775234761"]',NULL) ON CONFLICT(source_variant_id) DO NOTHING;
