(4) Résultats prouvés par tests d''efficacité et/ou tests consommateur sur 30 personnes.
(5) Test d''efficacité (cornéométrie) sur 11 volontaires',61500,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/ERBORIANE.jpg?v=1780676777',10,1,'8604668723375','47007580848303','https://beautymarket.ma/products/erborian-ginseng-power-creme-lissante-ridules-rides-50-ml',1,'["https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/ERBORIANE.jpg?v=1780676777","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/ED_11b52e79-8006-4c5e-a3c8-0f5f0a28aa4f.jpg?v=1780676182","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/ERBORIANEE.jpg?v=1780676992","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/05-EXPERTCONTENT-GINSENG-FR_1.webp?v=1780676591","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/04-EXPERTCONTENT-GINSENG-INGREDIENTS-FR.webp?v=1780676592","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/03-EXPERTCONTENT-GINSENG-BENEFITS-FR.webp?v=1780676591","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/02-EXPERTCONTENT-GINSENG-FRAVANTAPRES_1.webp?v=1780676591","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/8809255786842.jpg?v=1780676992","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/6AA20027_2_2.webp?v=1780676593"]',NULL) ON CONFLICT(source_variant_id) DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO products(name,brand,category,description,price,image,stock,active,source_product_id,source_variant_id,source_url,source_available,images_json,sku) VALUES ('ERBORIAN GINSENG POWER EYE CRÈME CONTOUR YEUX 15ML','Erborian','Solaires','Le Ginseng, notre meilleur actif coréen lissant, aussi efficace que le Rétinol1, dans une crème yeux qui défroisse les ridules en 3 minutes2 et lisse durablement les rides en 14 jours2.
